.33,"text":"Puis je l’emmenai voir mes amis : le hérisson, la chouette et les lucioles. « Voici Gribouille ! » Le hérisson lui fit une place sur la mousse. La chouette lui chanta bonjour. Et quand Gribouille fit « gri, gri » en riant, les lucioles se mirent à danser. « Ta musique est jolie ! » dirent-elles. Gribouille n’était plus caché. Il était avec nous.","words":[0.12,0.42,0.57,1.02,1.295,1.595,2.27,2.27,2.42,3.12,3.37,3.72,3.77,3.87,5.14,5.14,5.74,7.1,7.1,7.1,7.405,7.955,8.18,8.455,8.655,9.03,9.255,9.43,10.42,10.77,11.12,11.345,11.745,13.01,13.235,13.485,14.06,14.59,14.59,15.14,15.88,15.88,16.16,16.535,16.685,17.235,17.41,17.735,17.785,18.87,18.87,19.19,19.64,19.765,20.59,20.59,20.59,22.0,22.65,22.95,23.15,24.4,24.75,25.075,25.525],"visemes":[[0.0,"smile"],[0.17,"small"],[0.245,"o"],[0.345,"grin"],[0.645,"open"],[0.77,"small"],[0.845,"grin"],[1.045,"small"],[1.095,"o"],[1.145,"smile"],[1.22,"open"],[1.27,"small"],[1.395,"grin"],[1.62,"open"],[1.72,"small"],[1.795,"smile"],[1.87,"grin"],[2.22,"smile"],[2.295,"grin"],[2.82,"smile"],[3.145,"grin"],[3.22,"open"],[3.395,"grin"],[3.47,"o"],[3.57,"grin"],[3.945,"o"],[4.07,"grin"],[4.245,"smile"],[4.345,"o"],[4.445,"grin"],[4.625,"smile"],[5.315,"small"],[5.365,"open"],[5.515,"grin"],[5.99,"small"],[6.065,"smile"],[6.19,"o"],[6.315,"grin"],[6.555,"smile"],[7.205,"grin"],[7.855,"o"],[8.08,"grin"],[8.205,"small"],[8.305,"grin"],[8.48,"o"],[8.555,"grin"],[8.68,"small"],[8.73,"smile"],[8.855,"open"],[8.93,"grin"],[9.13,"o"],[9.205,"grin"],[9.355,"open"],[9.505,"smile"],[9.58,"o"],[9.705,"grin"],[9.905,"smile"],[10.545,"grin"],[10.62,"open"],[10.795,"grin"],[10.87,"o"],[10.97,"grin"],[11.195,"o"],[11.245,"grin"],[11.445,"open"],[11.495,"smile"],[11.57,"grin"],[11.67,"open"],[11.77,"small"],[11.845,"o"],[11.92,"smile"],[12.02,"grin"],[12.12,"smile"],[12.27,"o"],[12.395,"grin"],[12.495,"smile"],[13.11,"grin"],[13.335,"open"],[13.51,"grin"],[13.735,"small"],[13.835,"o"],[13.91,"grin"],[14.085,"small"],[14.16,"smile"],[14.235,"